  "notes": "Announced and released on 2023-03-14 in ChatGPT Plus and through an API waitlist. The 32K-context gpt-4-32k is an inline variant. GPT-4 with vision (GPT-4V, system card of 2023-09-25) is treated as a capability rollout of this model, not a separate record. The research post and the technical report (arXiv 2303.08774) are both primary; the GPT-4 system card PDF linked from the post carries no date. Lifecycle dates apply to the OpenAI API."
